ATS Resume Optimizer & Resume Generator

Overview

ATS Resume Optimizer & Resume Generator is an AI-powered tool designed to improve resume quality and ATS compatibility by comparing an existing resume with a target job description.

The tool helps job seekers identify missing keywords, optimize resume content, and generate recruiter-friendly resumes while maintaining complete factual accuracy.

Features

- ATS Match Score Calculation
- Resume & Job Description Analysis
- Missing Keyword Detection
- Skills Gap Analysis
- Resume Optimization Suggestions
- ATS-Friendly Resume Formatting
- Professional Resume Generation
- Recruiter-Focused Content Enhancement
- 100% Factual Accuracy Preservation

Workflow

1. Upload Existing Resume
2. Provide Target Job Description
3. Analyze Resume Against JD
4. Generate ATS Match Score
5. Identify Missing Keywords & Skills
6. Receive Improvement Suggestions
7. Generate Optimized Resume

